    va2: [m('Ahora, ideas abstractas y presentaciones. Imagina que subes a un escenario… pero académico.', 'Now, abstract ideas and presentations. Imagine you go up on a stage… an academic one.'), m('Lo importante no es saberlo todo, sino saber guiar al público.', 'The important thing is not to know everything, but to know how to guide the audience.')]
